  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2024 GRANT TO IRISH RULE OF LAW ACCESS TO JUSTICE PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IRLI aims to tackle existing barriers in the criminal justice system. Responding to lessons learned this programme addresses (1) the need for programme expansion beyond the existing focus on the Central Region of Malawi (2) expansion into civil law. (3 Increased focus on the use of data to improve institutional performance and accountability and (4) localisation and identifying effective local organisations for partnership to support advocacy on key human rights issues.</narrative>
  </description>
